{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "04e625efc9800949fff961c7bf50cd9d8e3c310e03664d99d953c40273b5bd4a", "ja": "グラビア撮影前", "zh": "写真摄影前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4001_022ser", "source_sha256": "73209c4f896dc14c686f14e41d9385453bc605531a9d93790ca539afa8f731e9", "ja": "う～ん……。\nあの、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "唔～嗯……\n那个，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4002_p", "source_sha256": "b8bcfd6573d28eda0d14090c614e8ad0e075bcee439ddc87a863b2a612db238d", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　星梨花。\nやけに困った顔して……。", "zh": "怎么了？星梨花。\n一脸烦恼的表情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4003_022ser", "source_sha256": "83d61b22aea438755495d11e6988c70751dfdba42ae52f34577c270aa7a734ea", "ja": "男の人って、女の人がどんな格好をしてると、\nうれしいんでしょうか？", "zh": "女性打扮成什么样子，\n会让男性觉得开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4004_p", "source_sha256": "b755d192ba8a6925f3ae4e9704e6b73961e9fb3bf2044faa6d06a7af4743c903", "ja": "うれしいって、何の話だ？", "zh": "什么开不开心，怎么会问这种问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4005_022ser", "source_sha256": "4525af7f8a9148d314ea90a1a51683811fbe32a2ef550df456ca5a4c60ce2b9a", "ja": "はい！　今日はわたし、\nグラビア写真っていうのを撮るんですよね？", "zh": "是的！今天我要拍摄\n那个叫做写真的东西对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4006_022ser", "source_sha256": "68c8715ec9055470aeb295304420946237a1286e8e7cf8917109d6adbdc530c7", "ja": "莉緒さんから聞きました！　いいグラビアを撮るには、\n男の人の意見が重要なんですよね？", "zh": "我听莉绪姊姊说了！要拍出好的写真集，\n男性的意见很重要对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4007_022ser", "source_sha256": "0bb966d126f7aa6370c8e0a6409cf2744078592ccffabfdd61f671ab6a017bb9", "ja": "だから、{$P$}さんの\n意見を参考にしようと思ったんです。", "zh": "所以，我想把{$P$}先生的意见\n作为参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4008_p", "source_sha256": "862569b0809fa8e05252bfeac3bb6e24c54a8cecdd5aa55749c933ef9e2608dd", "ja": "莉緒……。\nいや、星梨花。それはあまり気にしなくていい。", "zh": "莉绪……\n不，星梨花。你不需要太在意那种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4009_022ser", "source_sha256": "6955385b9fc86cc033f8139bec7a53fef8873cb908acd97642ff6cddaced0eb9", "ja": "そうなんですか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4010_p", "source_sha256": "0352dcf7ec8406dc921f3e3b3f251dd6566422c5fab72c58819dde3961712cbc", "ja": "うん。\n今日撮影する星梨花のグラビアに大事なのは……。", "zh": "嗯。\n今天星梨花拍摄写真最重要的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4011", "source_sha256": "e893394d71dff5a3528b7fc2c6dc835fbdf32ba32dce2b8de65003697c53acb1", "ja": "笑顔だ", "zh": "笑容", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4012", "source_sha256": "abf7c180d2fc269af619e2b3ecc1f54e576ad8d90150b35afee6fb0d8276ee13", "ja": "心だ", "zh": "心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4013", "source_sha256": "e5e5d5b50ace4573f48e7763e3f6d48f037c11558879e625c6179ee10bacde9a", "ja": "照明だ", "zh": "灯光", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4100_p", "source_sha256": "299786750cfc9728498ac2d7fc6e4235ac122e15675ec07d6743cf44e2bc7b5e", "ja": "笑顔こそが、グラビアの真髄だ！　ファンの人達は、\nやっぱりアイドルの笑顔を見たいわけだからな。", "zh": "笑容才是写真的精髓！\n粉丝们想见到终究还是偶像的笑容啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4101_022ser", "source_sha256": "ca7307f368d0f6a8e084dcd40031dd9f2ca473354b8a0b58ecb04c5b14c718de", "ja": "真髄ですか……むずかしい言葉ですけど、\nわたし、なんとなくわかった気がします！", "zh": "精髓吗……好难的词呢，\n但是我好像隐隐约约明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4102_022ser", "source_sha256": "098c1dd972c235e50590798bbeaf83f1fddfff76c02af678c82218a636bf6b34", "ja": "えへへ、{$P$}さんって、やっぱり\nすごいプロデューサーさんなんですね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，{$P$}先生\n果然是位很厉害的制作人呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4200_p", "source_sha256": "6a99f8c9d5299233fc08898934a49f8d28ea7d1b3322444fc96091fe8e75824a", "ja": "心だ！　どんなアイドルのグラビアも、\nそこにファンを想う心がなければ、何の意味もない。", "zh": "是心！无论是什么偶像的写真，\n如果没有为粉丝着想的心，就没有任何意义。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4201_022ser", "source_sha256": "e3f737db7c10f2b552057da50faa8b3114ffdaed665cedc9a291398830ae4d73", "ja": "ファンのみなさんを、想う心……ですか？\nわかるような、わからないような……？", "zh": "为粉丝着想的心……是吗？\n感觉似懂非懂呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4202_022ser", "source_sha256": "0dbd7d8b17a87e04e93811f83a7e2a2ea711ef7fdb1fc922006cc86ef31abc96", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんがそう言うなら、\nそれはきっと大事なことなんですよね。", "zh": "不过，既然{$P$}先生都这么说了，\n那一定是很重要的事情对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4203_022ser", "source_sha256": "31230c35974525d2900554ca111e74703e364168d60c55ed274d4207f2b23f89", "ja": "わたし、おうちに帰って、\nもう一度、よく考えてみますっ。", "zh": "我回家以后，\n会再仔细思考一次的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4300_p", "source_sha256": "c256a6a4d861c1938c740509f41b7b8426754b769eacef8240a57862bde977e4", "ja": "照明だ！　これさえあれば\nどんなアイドルも光輝く魔法の装置！", "zh": "是灯光！只要有这个魔法装置，\n无论什么偶像都能够发光发热！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4301_022ser", "source_sha256": "2ff9d3a7b5b8e6c1c2fd51c539335150886afa8e0bd28d3270c0a8cb968e8bce", "ja": "え？　……ええっと、照明、ですか？", "zh": "咦？呃……灯光，是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4302_022ser", "source_sha256": "e8c6f75092376d4de1862ffb66563390a28d2e031c8196da6db41ebbb969fbc4", "ja": "照明……う～ん、よくわかりません……いったい、\nどういう意味なんでしょう……？", "zh": "灯光……唔～我不是很懂……\n那到底是什么意思呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_4303_p", "source_sha256": "3155ecf9cebeb1d83edf8c2961423c4fce5dc78b0733141c93d8a6025d7b45d8", "ja": "だから星梨花は、撮影に集中して……。\nおーい、星梨花？　聞いてるか？", "zh": "所以说，星梨花集中精神拍摄……\n喂～星梨花？你有在听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
